issue_context.body:
### Description

When a type implementing `IDynamicInterfaceCastable` is used to obtain an interface with a generic method, calling this method ignores the `IDynamicInterfaceCastable.GetInterfaceImplementation` completely and instead throws (somewhat cryptic) `System.EntryPointNotFoundException`.

### Reproduction Steps

```cs
using System;
using System.Linq;
using System.Runtime.InteropServices;
					
public class Program
{
	public static void Main()
	{
		var castable = new Castable();
		Console.WriteLine("Querying interface");
		var test = (IQueryProvider)castable;
		Console.WriteLine("Calling interface");
		test.CreateQuery<int>(null!); // removing <int> works
	}
}

class Castable : IDynamicInterfaceCastable
{
	bool IDynamicInterfaceCastable.IsInterfaceImplemented(RuntimeTypeHandle interfaceType, bool throwIfNotImplemented)
	{
		Console.WriteLine("Checking interface " + Type.GetTypeFromHandle(interfaceType));
		return true;
	}

	RuntimeTypeHandle IDynamicInterfaceCastable.GetInterfaceImplementation(RuntimeTypeHandle interfaceType)
	{
		Console.WriteLine("Obtaining interface " + Type.GetTypeFromHandle(interfaceType));
		return default;
	}
}
```

### Expected behavior

The `GetInterfaceImplementation` implementation should be used (an exception in this case since a valid type is not returned anyway):
```
Querying interface
Checking interface System.Linq.IQueryProvider
Calling interface
Obtaining interface System.Linq.IQueryProvider
Unhandled exception. System.InvalidCastException: Invalid cast from 'ImplementsAnything' to 'System.Linq.IQueryProvider'.
   at System.Linq.IQueryProvider.CreateQuery(Expression expression)
   at Program.Main()
```

### Actual behavior

`GetInterfaceImplementation` is ignored completely:
```
Querying interface
Checking interface System.Linq.IQueryProvider
Calling interface
Unhandled exception. System.EntryPointNotFoundException: Entry point was not found.
   at Program.Main()
```

### Regression?

Does not work in any version of .NET from 5 to 8.

### Known Workarounds

_No response_

### Configuration

.NET 8 Preview 3

